        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 2BB, Solid Brass 2\" Barrel Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 Inch Barrel Bolt is available in 9 great finishes. Because of the small 2 inch size, the Deltana made Solid Brass Barrel Bolt can be used on just about anything, from wood projects around the house, to doors, to cabinets. Includes matching solid brass screws.  Available in an array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-2BB.gif?v=1704354587\" width=\"600\" height=\"248\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Solid Brass 2\" Barrel Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available larger  <a href=\"/products/3-inch-solid-brass-barrel-bolt-deltana-3bb\"><b>3 Inch Barrel Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana 2BB Barrel Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Housing Length: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Housing Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching solid brass screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/2BB.pdf?v=1691095268\" target=\"new\"><B>Deltana 2BB  Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which of the 9 finishes you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2 Inch Solid Brass Barrel Bolt",
                "description": "Solid Brass 2 Inch Barrel Bolt, Deltana 2BB - The 2 Inch Barrel Bolt is available in 9 great finishes. Because of the small 2 inch size, the Deltana made Solid Brass Barrel Bolt can be used on just about anything, from wood projects around the house, to doors, to cabinets. Includes matching solid brass screws. Available in an array of finishes.",
